<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="延伸閱讀"><span id=".E5.BB.B6.E4.BC.B8.E9.96.B1.E8.AE.80"></span>延伸閱讀</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E4%BE%B5%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="編輯章節：延伸閱讀"><span>編輯</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
